{
    "chapter_num": 11,
    "verses_count": 33,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Concern for Their Faithfulness"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Oh, that you would bear with me in a little folly—and indeed you do bear with me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I am jealous for you with godly jealousy. For I have betrothed you to one husband, that I may present "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a chaste virgin to Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I fear, lest somehow, as the serpent deceived Eve by his craftiness, so your minds may be corrupted from the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU adds and purity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "simplicity that is in Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if he who comes preaches another Jesus whom we have not preached, or "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "if"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you receive a different spirit which you have not received, or a different gospel which you have not accepted—you may well put up with it!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Paul and False Apostles"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I consider that I am not at all inferior to the most eminent apostles. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even though "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "I am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " untrained in speech, yet "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "I am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not in knowledge. But we have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits been"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "been thoroughly manifested among you in all things."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Did I commit sin in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "putting myself down"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "humbling myself that you might be exalted, because I preached the gospel of God to you free of charge? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I robbed other churches, taking wages "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "from them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to minister to you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when I was present with you, and in need, I was a burden to no one, for what I lacked the brethren who came from Macedonia supplied. And in everything I kept myself from being burdensome to you, and so I will keep "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "myself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As the truth of Christ is in me, no one shall stop me from this boasting in the regions of Achaia. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Why? Because I do not love you? God knows!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But what I do, I will also continue to do, that I may cut off the opportunity from those who desire an opportunity to be regarded just as we are in the things of which they boast. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For such "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " false apostles, deceitful workers, transforming themselves into apostles of Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And no wonder! For Satan himself transforms himself into an angel of light. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no great thing if his ministers also transform themselves into ministers of righteousness, whose end will be according to their works."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Reluctant Boasting"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I say again, let no one think me a fool. If otherwise, at least receive me as a fool, that I also may boast a little. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What I speak, I speak not according to the Lord, but as it were, foolishly, in this confidence of boasting. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Seeing that many boast according to the flesh, I also will boast. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you put up with fools gladly, since you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "yourselves"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " are wise! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you put up with it if one brings you into bondage, if one devours "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " if one takes "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "from you,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " if one exalts himself, if one strikes you on the face. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "our"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " shame I say that we were too weak for that! But in whatever anyone is bold—I speak foolishly—I am bold also."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Suffering for Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Are they Hebrews? So "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I. Are they Israelites? So "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I. Are they the seed of Abraham? So "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Are they ministers of Christ?—I speak as a fool—I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " more: in labors more abundant, in stripes above measure, in prisons more frequently, in deaths often. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "From the Jews five times I received forty "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "stripes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " minus one. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Three times I was beaten with rods; once I was stoned; three times I was shipwrecked; a night and a day I have been in the deep; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " journeys often, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils of waters, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils of robbers, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "my own"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " countrymen, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils of the Gentiles, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils in the city, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils in the wilderness, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils in the sea, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perils among false brethren; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in weariness and toil, in sleeplessness often, in hunger and thirst, in fastings often, in cold and nakedness— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "besides the other things, what comes upon me daily: my deep concern for all the churches. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Who is weak, and I am not weak? Who is made to stumble, and I do not burn "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "with indignation?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If I must boast, I will boast in the things which concern my "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "weakness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "infirmity. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, who is blessed forever, knows that I am not lying. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In Damascus the governor, under Aretas the king, was guarding the city of the Damascenes with a garrison, desiring to arrest me; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but I was let down in a basket through a window in the wall, and escaped from his hands."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}